        <mxCell id="legend_content" value="VIEW 1: v_claims_tableau (Primary Detail View)&#10;   - All 6 normalized tables denormalized into single row per claim&#10;   - Includes geographical coordinates for Tableau map visualization (latitude, longitude)&#10;   - Calculated fields: cost_tier, age_group, bmi_category, denial_flag&#10;   - Tableau Use: Worksheets 1-5 (Maps, Regional Analysis, Provider, Diagnosis, Time-Series)&#10;   - Connection Type: LIVE MySQL connection (real-time)&#10;&#10;VIEW 2: v_demographic_segmentation (Pre-aggregated Heatmap Data - 40 cells)&#10;   - Structure: 5 age groups X 4 BMI categories X 2 smoking statuses = 40 demographic cells&#10;   - Metrics: patient_count, claim_count, total_cost, denial_rate_pct, risk_tier, min/max/avg/stddev&#10;   - Tableau Use: Worksheet 7 (Demographic Heatmap - Age vs BMI vs Smoking Risk Analysis)&#10;   - Performance: Pre-aggregated view eliminates real-time computation overhead&#10;&#10;VIEW 3: v_rfm_analysis (Customer Lifetime Value RFM Segmentation - 8 Segments)&#10;   - Customer segments based on Recency, Frequency, Monetary value analysis&#10;   - Segments: Champions, Loyal, Potential Loyalists, New Members, At-Risk, Hibernating, Lost&#10;   - Metrics: RFM score (0-4 quartiles), lifetime value, claim behavior, demographics&#10;   - Tableau Use: Worksheet 8 (RFM Bubble Chart for Member Lifecycle Analysis)&#10;   - Strategic Use: Customer retention planning, lifetime value optimization, engagement strategy" style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#f9f9f9;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
